      "title": "GitLab CI: Simplify our Windows paths.",
      "message": "GitLab CI: Simplify our Windows paths.\n\nCMake's FindPerl module and our FindNSIS and FindWiX modules can find\nperl, makensis, and the various WiX utilities in their default locations\nso we don't need to prepopulate our PATH.\n\nUpdate FindWiX to look for version 3.11.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2021-12-22T11:51:05.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
